OL,3,GNEWSA'Incompetent' nurse 'stared
OL,4,Ablankly' at patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "rude and awkward" nurse whose
OL,7,Femployment was terminated during her
OL,8,Fprobationary period is set to be struck
OL,9,Foff after a panel ruled she presented a
OL,10,F"significant risk of harm" to patients.
OL,12,FLouise Woodgate, from Suffolk, was let
OL,13,Fgo by Homelink Healthcare Ltd in April
OL,14,F2023, six months after being employed
OL,15,Fas a community nurse who provided
OL,16,Fintravenous (IV) treatment.
OL,18,FWoodgate reportedly showed a serious
OL,19,Flack of competence through multiple
OL,20,Ffailings in infection control and
OL,21,Fmedication management and "stared
OL,22,Fblankly at patients".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
