OL,3,GNEWSA'Incompetent' nurse 'stared
OL,4,Ablankly' at patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Nursing and Midwifery Council said
OL,7,Fthe nurse's actions amounted to
OL,8,Fmisconduct and she would be removed
OL,9,Ffrom the register in 18 months if she
OL,10,Fdoes not appeal.
